.2026.pdf\">Title I Summer Reallocation Procedures</a></li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</dd>\r\n</dl>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"blockhead\">\r\n<h2>&nbsp;Continuous School Improvement - Title I Section 1003</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary mb-3\"><strong>School Improvement Resources</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">\r\n\t<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aolwWcF3jOk\">FY27 SIG Application Part 1: Substantial Approval</a>&nbsp;(Video)<br />\r\n\t<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XZzv8Ff79pE\">FY27 SIG Application Part 2a: Final Approval Plan</a>&nbsp;(Video)<br />\r\n\t<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Tm6M5T_htI&amp;feature=youtu.be\">FY27 SIG Application Part 2b: Final Approval Budget</a>&nbsp;(Video)</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">\r\n\t<p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"8e583d52-242f-4003-94b1-544d11fdee8b\" filename=\"ESEA - Selecting Professional Development Guidance - 5.29.2026.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20Selecting%20Professional%20Development%20Guidance%20-%205.29.2026.docx\">Selecting Professional Development Guidance - Word Document</a><br />\r\n\t<a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"12602734-3df2-4d36-ab68-1a12bd19a813\" filename=\"ESEA - Selecting Professional Development Guidance - 5.292.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20Selecting%20Professional%20Development%20Guidance%20-%205.292.2026.pdf\">Selecting Professional Development Guidance - PDF</a></span></span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">\